Process Management:
```````````````````
Process:
````````
- Any running program is a process
- Multiple instances of the same program are processes.
- Shell is also a process


Process ID (PID)
````````````````
- Each Linux process is identified by unique id PID 
- Every process has a Parent Process ID (PPID)
	+ Except "init"



